## eLMOS Infrastructure Skills

Use `/skills` or explicitly reference the installed `elmos-*` Skill matching the task.

For broad work, invoke `elmos-infrastructure-program-orchestrator`. Maintain a durable implementation plan, implement the smallest dependency-resolved vertical slice, execute repository-native tests plus failure/security/recovery tests, preserve evidence, and never describe scaffolding as production completion. Report eLMOS autonomous wall-clock ETA and actual duration separately from manual engineering/review effort.
